#!/bin/bash
# fnnas.reminder 生命周期脚本
# 由飞牛应用中心调用：main start | stop | status
# status: 运行中 exit 0，未运行 exit 3

APP_DIR="${TRIM_APPDEST}"
DATA_DIR="${TRIM_PKGVAR}/data"
LOG_FILE="${TRIM_PKGVAR}/app.log"
PID_FILE="${TRIM_PKGVAR}/app.pid"
PORT="${TRIM_SERVICE_PORT:-8388}"
LOGFILE="${TRIM_TEMP_LOGFILE:-/dev/stderr}"

# fnOS 的 Python 运行时（由 manifest 的 install_dep_apps=python312 自动安装）
export PATH="/var/apps/python312/target/bin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin:$PATH"
export TZ="Asia/Shanghai"
export PYTHONUNBUFFERED=1
export PYTHONIOENCODING=utf-8

fail() { echo "$1" > "$LOGFILE"; exit 1; }

running() {
    [ -f "$PID_FILE" ] || return 1
    local pid
    pid=$(head -n 1 "$PID_FILE" 2>/dev/null | tr -d '[:space:]')
    [ -n "$pid" ] || return 1
    kill -0 "$pid" 2>/dev/null
}

case "$1" in
start)
    if running; then
        echo "已在运行 (pid $(cat "$PID_FILE"))"
        exit 0
    fi
    # python312 的 bin 已在文件头加到 PATH 最前；再兜底扫一遍 /var/apps/python3*
    PY="$(command -v python3 || true)"
    if [ -z "$PY" ]; then
        PY="$(ls -1 /var/apps/python3*/target/bin/python3 2>/dev/null | head -n 1)"
    fi
    [ -n "$PY" ] || fail "未找到 python3，请在应用中心安装「Python 3.12」运行时（python312）后重试。"
    [ -f "${APP_DIR}/server.py" ] || fail "应用文件缺失：${APP_DIR}/server.py"
    mkdir -p "$DATA_DIR" || fail "无法创建数据目录：$DATA_DIR"

    cd "$APP_DIR" || fail "无法进入应用目录：$APP_DIR"
    DATA_DIR="$DATA_DIR" PORT="$PORT" "$PY" server.py >> "$LOG_FILE" 2>&1 &
    echo $! > "$PID_FILE"
    sleep 2

    if running; then
        echo "启动成功，端口 ${PORT}，数据目录 ${DATA_DIR}"
        exit 0
    fi
    tail -n 20 "$LOG_FILE" > "$LOGFILE" 2>/dev/null
    fail "启动失败，完整日志见 ${LOG_FILE}"
    ;;

stop)
    if ! running; then
        rm -f "$PID_FILE"
        exit 0
    fi
    pid=$(head -n 1 "$PID_FILE" | tr -d '[:space:]')
    kill -TERM "$pid" 2>/dev/null
    for _ in $(seq 1 10); do
        kill -0 "$pid" 2>/dev/null || break
        sleep 1
    done
    kill -0 "$pid" 2>/dev/null && kill -KILL "$pid" 2>/dev/null
    rm -f "$PID_FILE"
    echo "已停止"
    exit 0
    ;;

status)
    running && exit 0
    exit 3
    ;;

*)
    exit 1
    ;;
esac
